It's easy for a web agency to promise results. Everyone does it. "More traffic", "better rankings", "increased enquiries" — the language is the same everywhere.

We'd rather show you what's actually happened. Here are real outcomes from real NC Digital clients across South Wales — with the numbers, what we did, and what changed.

## K Williams Roofing — First Page of Google, More Inbound Leads

**The situation:** K Williams Roofing had no website and relied entirely on word of mouth. A solid local reputation, but no Google presence — meaning anyone searching for a roofer in Merthyr Tydfil found their competitors instead.

**What we did:** Built a mobile-first website with individual service pages, trust signals, and local SEO targeting across roofing-related search terms.

**The result:** First page of Google for local roofing searches. Significant increase in inbound enquiries. Reduced reliance on referrals as the sole source of new business.

[View portfolio](/portfolio/k-williams-roofing/)

---

## IR Energy — +76% Clicks, +164% Impressions, 50 Enquiries in 3 Months

**The situation:** IR Energy — a renewable energy installer in Merthyr Tydfil — had a website but weren't getting results from their previous agency. Before working with us, they were generating just two to three quote request forms per month.

**What we did:** Redesigned the homepage to properly reflect their expertise and convert visitors. Followed it with a three-month local SEO campaign building 20 targeted ranking pages across South Wales, covering solar, battery storage, heat pumps, EV charging, and insulation.

**The result:**
- +76% increase in clicks from Google
- +164% increase in search impressions
- 50 tracked enquiries (form submissions, phone clicks, email interactions) in three months

[See the IR Energy case study](/blog/ir-energy-seo-case-study/) | [View portfolio](/portfolio/ir-energy/)

---

## AK Promotions — 2,800 Visits and 75 Enquiries, Zero Ad Spend

**The situation:** AK Promotions, a Merthyr Tydfil events and promotions company, needed a website that matched their brand and converted their social media audience into real enquiries and ticket sales.

**What we did:** Built a bold, modern website with event showcase, service listings, ecommerce for ticket sales, and a clear contact journey. Also handled logo design and brand identity as part of the project.

**The result (August 2025 – April 2026, no paid advertising):**
- 2,800+ total site visits
- 75 enquiry forms submitted
- 576 clicks from Google Search
- 8,290 search impressions
- Traffic driven by organic social (44%) and search (28%)

[See the AK Promotions case study](/blog/ak-promotions-website-case-study/) | [View portfolio](/portfolio/ak-promotions/)

---

## Electrician Merthyr Tydfil — Live in Days, Ranking for Local Search Terms

**The situation:** A local electrician needed a professional website quickly and affordably — no large upfront cost, no long process.

**What we did:** Built a managed website under our [managed starter website service](/services/managed-starter-websites/). Dedicated service pages, areas served, Google Business Profile optimisation, domain and hosting included. Live within days.

**The result:** Professional site live within days of briefing. Ranks for local electrician search terms in Merthyr Tydfil and surrounding areas. Consistent enquiries via quote forms and direct contact.

[See the case study](/blog/electrician-merthyr-tydfil-case-study/) | [View portfolio](/portfolio/electrician-merthyr-tydfil/)

